ntract coverage only.\n- No remote Supabase mutation, schema push, storage upload, HTTP write probe, external VLM, or UI/Paper Workspace edits.\n- Visual-required rows remain blocked before valid exposure; text-only rows retain local attemptability without authoritative scoring.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm test -- --runInBand api/learning/__tests__/runtime-contract.test.js api/learning/__tests__/supabase-projection-runtime-contract.test.js api/learning/__tests__/question-search-service.test.js --verbose`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint api/learning/lib/contracts/supabase-projection-runtime-adapter.js api/learning/lib/questions/question-search-service.js api/learning/__tests__/supabase-projection-runtime-contract.test.js api/learning/__tests__/question-search-service.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n\nNote: full `npm run lint` still fails on pre-existing unrelated frontend lint errors outside this PR's touched files.\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T07:56:42Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T08:40:00Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T08:40:00Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T08:40:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"cb330b45d37455bd3584efe1e7d98ab97b22ae01","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1225/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1225/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1225/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/f9953aca15751b891a1eab82c9aba260286063fc","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1203","ref":"feat/issue-1203","sha":"f9953aca15751b891a1eab82c9aba260286063fc","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url